---
import { BUSINESS_CONTACT } from '../lib/businessContact';
import HelloFraandsPage from '../layouts/HelloFraandsPage.astro';
import { BRAND } from '../lib/brand';
---
<HelloFraandsPage updated="2026-10-28" title="Terms of use" summary="Yeh seva aapko apne favourite influencer se private phone call par jodti hai; istemal se pehle niyam padhein." review={true} related={[{"href":"/wallet-terms","label":"Wallet terms"},{"href":"/community-guidelines","label":"Community guidelines"},{"href":"/disclaimer","label":"Service disclaimer"},{"href":"/privacy","label":"Privacy policy"}]}>
<h2>Business and contact details</h2>
<p>The public business name for {BRAND.name} is {BUSINESS_CONTACT.name}.</p>
<p>Public postal address: {BUSINESS_CONTACT.postalAddress}.</p>
<p>For complaints, use the <a href="/grievance">grievance process</a> or email <a href={`mailto:${BRAND.emails.grievance}`}>{BRAND.emails.grievance}</a>.</p>
<h2>Using the service</h2>
<p>Read these terms before creating a {BRAND.name} account or starting a paid conversation. Check the price, availability and eligibility requirements shown before starting a call.</p>
<h2>Account and eligibility</h2>
<p>For account or service questions, contact <a href={`mailto:${BRAND.emails.support}`}>{BRAND.emails.support}</a>.</p>
<p>The service is intended for adults aged 18 or older in India using their own phone number. Any creator may choose, for free, to take calls only from customers who have completed video KYC. We never share any customer&rsquo;s details with anyone.</p>
<h2>Conversation and call acceptance</h2>
<p>Your purchase is time on a private phone call with an influencer, at the per-minute rate set by that influencer and shown before the call. This is not a dating, professional advice, therapy, or emergency service. Influencers must not present a conversation as medical, legal, or financial advice.</p>
<p>The call flow checks eligibility, influencer availability, blocks, account restrictions, and at least ₹20 in your wallet. Our system first calls the influencer and announces that you want to talk. Only if the influencer accepts do we call you and merge the two calls. Both calls come from a {BRAND.name} number, so your private number is never shared with the influencer, and theirs is never shared with you. A call is made once we have rung both of you and joined the call, and you pay per minute spoken. If the influencer declines, cancels or does not answer, you pay nothing. If a joined call breaks within the first minute, we charge ₹1 and return the rest to your wallet.</p>
<h2>Billing and conduct</h2>
<p>Billing is by the minute spoken, after we have joined both parties, at the per-minute rate set by the influencer. Read the <a href="/wallet-terms">wallet terms</a> and <a href="/refunds">refund policy</a>. Every call is recorded for safety and nobody listens live (see <em>Recording and safety checks</em> below). Spammy, sexual or threatening behaviour is not allowed, and you can press # to end a call and block the person. See the <a href="/safety">safety centre</a>.</p>
<p>Follow the <a href="/community-guidelines">community guidelines</a>: no sexual or abusive talk, sharing contact details, selling, financial tips, loans, network marketing, adult services, or payment outside {BRAND.name}. Influencer controls include ending the call with * and ending the call and blocking the caller with #.</p>
<h2>Wellbeing and the nature of the service</h2>
<p>The service only connects calls between adults. Influencers are independent individuals, not employees, counsellors or mental-health professionals, and a conversation is not a relationship, therapy or crisis service. You remain responsible for your own decisions and wellbeing. If you are in crisis, call Tele-MANAS 14416 or 112.</p>
<p>To protect callers and influencers, the platform may apply healthy-use limits: a daily time limit with the same influencer, a cooling-off gap between calls to that influencer, and an extra check before large top-ups. The platform may also limit or end contact between a caller and an influencer for wellbeing reasons. A limited caller sees only that the influencer is not available; it is not a decision of the influencer. See <a href="/wellbeing">use it in a healthy way</a>.</p>
<h2>Your acknowledgement</h2>
<p>Before first use, callers are asked to confirm: “I understand this is a phone call with an influencer, not counselling, therapy or a relationship service. Influencers are independent people and are not mental-health professionals. If I am in crisis I will call Tele-MANAS 14416 or 112. I am 18 or older.” Before each call, both people hear a short notice: “This is a private call, not counselling. In crisis, dial 14416.”</p>
<h2>Recording and safety checks</h2>
<p>Every call is recorded for safety. Nobody listens to a call live. After the call, an AI system turns the recording into text and checks it against our <a href="/community-guidelines">community guidelines</a>. By using the service you agree to this, whether you are a fan or an influencer. Do not share your phone number, UPI ID or address on a call, and never pay anyone outside {BRAND.name}.</p>
<p>Only named members of our safety team can read the text of a call, and they see only what they need. The <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a> says how long each thing is kept.</p>
<h2>Restrictions and review</h2>
<p>A strike is given for one call and one person, a fan or an influencer. When the AI is very sure a rule was broken, a strike can be given straight away. When it is less sure, our safety team looks first and decides. A strike counts for 90 days. Three active strikes pause the account. Only a person on our team can ban an account. A ban is permanent and the phone number cannot be used to sign up again. Threats, sexual harassment or fraud can mean an immediate ban. If someone may be in danger, we can pause the account at once until our team has looked. Blocks by three distinct influencers trigger a freeze pending review, and two #-ended calls within 24 hours trigger a 24-hour suspension. A mention of self-harm is routed for welfare review, never a strike by itself.</p>
<p>You can appeal each strike once, by replying APPEAL to the WhatsApp message about it or with the Appeal button in the app or on the website. A person reviews it, and if it is accepted the strike is removed.</p>
<p>When an influencer's account is paused, new calls and bookings stop, booked calls are cancelled with a full refund to the fans' wallets, and the influencer's earnings are held until our review ends. A paused fan cannot call or book but can still sign in and withdraw wallet money. If a ban is confirmed, fans of the flagged calls are refunded first from the held money, and the rest is paid to the influencer's UPI ID as for a closed account.
<p>A block or safety cut still bills the minutes spoken at the rate shown before the call. Calls that were made are not refunded, except under the first-minute rule, and every refund goes to your wallet, never to your card or UPI. Money is never forfeited as a penalty: a banned account cannot make calls, but can still sign in and withdraw wallet money with the Withdraw button. You may request review of an incorrect restriction through the <a href="/grievance">grievance process</a>.</p>
<h2>Service limits</h2>
<p>No particular conversation outcome, uninterrupted connection, or prevention of every harmful interaction is promised. Nothing in these terms is intended to remove rights that cannot lawfully be excluded.</p>
</HelloFraandsPage>
